  "bodyHash": "3d4841d08415add5",
  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>提示框全面重制 ✨</strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">为 Minecraft 提示框带来全新的视觉升级，彻底替换原版提示框系统，采用更清晰的布局。每一个提示框都<em>更加现代、锐利、清晰</em>。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>核心功能</strong> 🔧</h1>\n<p>📜 <strong>可滚动提示框</strong> - 当提示框过高超出屏幕范围时，您可以<em>滚动</em>查看其全部内容。<br>✂️ <strong>文本换行</strong> - 通过<em>自动插入换行符</em>，防止提示框过宽。<br>🦋 <strong>装备对比</strong> - 内置可开关的装备对比功能，可将当前穿戴的盔甲与其他装备进行对比。您可在游戏内更改快捷键。<br>🤝 <strong>兼容性</strong> - 完美支持 <em>JEI</em>、<em>EMI</em>、<em>ModernFix</em>、<em>Flerovium</em>、<em>FTB Quests</em>、<em>Apotheosis</em> 等模组。<br>🎨 <strong>高度自定义</strong> - 您可以随意修改、裁剪、扩展和移动<em>任何元素</em>！在丰富的选项中自由<em>定制</em>您的体验！<br>📊 <strong>品质标识</strong> - 在物品名称正下方显示<em>稀有度/品质评价</em>（可配置，默认关闭）。<br>⚡ <strong>特效与边框</strong> - 提供多种动态<em>边框</em>、覆盖层及自定义样式供您选择。<br>🧩 <strong>模组兼容</strong> - 任何模组均可添加自定义边框。<br>🌀 <strong>物品3D渲染</strong> - 鼠标悬停在物品上时，将显示3D图标。<br>🎲 <strong>晕影效果</strong> - 一种全新的装饰方式，允许您在提示框内部添加各种形状的渐变效果。<br>🎠 <strong>提示框动画</strong> - 可为任意提示框添加出现/消失动画！<br>🍳 <strong>自定义边框</strong> - 从一系列预设的边角样式中选择，打造符合您审美的外观。<br>❄️ <strong>游戏内配置界面</strong> - 此外，支持完全自定义的游戏内配置界面，让您无需退出游戏即可调整设置。<br>🔥 <strong>游戏内实时预览</strong> - 修改特定物品时，可通过模组配置界面实时预览提示框外观的变化。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana\">📦 <em><strong>默认情况下，部分原版物品已包含边框。</strong></em><br>如果您喜欢这个概念，我们可以为最受欢迎的模组创建自定义边框并添加原生支持。🙌</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana\">本模组具有极高的可配置性。如有任何问题、建议、贡献意愿，或关于内容/模组的新想法，欢迎加入我们的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://discord.com/invite/Pxj3gdhGj8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">💬 官方 Discord</a> 并在相应频道留言。</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fPxj3gdhGj8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1018043/description_a255b953-62ec-43d7-b4b3-8a1a94b36bac.png\" alt=\"Discord横幅\"></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana\">所有Bug反馈或功能请求请发至我的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fPxj3gdhGj8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord服务器</a>。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><strong>配置说明 ⚙️</strong></h1>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">配置提示框共有<strong>两种</strong>方式：<em>全局配置</em>或<em>特定配置</em>。📝</span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;对于<strong>全局配置</strong>，您需要修改文件 </span></span> <code>config/tooltipoverhaul/tooltipoverhaul.toml</code><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，其中包含适用于所有物品的通用配置选项。</span></span></li>\n<li>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;对于<strong>特定配置</strong> <em>（针对特定物品、标签或命名空间/模组ID）</em>，您需要修改位于&nbsp;</span></span>&nbsp;<code>config/tooltipoverhaul/custom_frames.json</code><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">的文件。有关如何使用此文件的更多信息，请参阅此 <a href=\"https://github.com/Xylonity/Tooltip-Overhaul/wiki/Configuration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>维基页面</strong></a>。</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>要重新加载<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">特定配置</span>，您可以在不重启游戏的情况下使用命令 <code>'/tooltipoverhaul reload'</code>，而全局设置会在保存后自动重新加载！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>⚠️ 本模组现已内置游戏内配置工具，只需几次点击即可可视化完成所有配置，无需再修改本地文件。此外，针对特定配置也提供了实时预览功能（通过游戏内配置界面），更新即时生效，让您无需再浪费时间在维基上查找具体设置！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><strong>资源包 🎨</strong></h1>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>资源包</strong>也可用于添加自定义边框或配置。如需更多信息，请查阅 <a href=\"https://github.com/Xylonity/Tooltip-Overhaul/wiki/Custom-Frame\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>维基页面</strong></a>。<br></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>推荐查看</strong>以下<em>材质包</em>，它们添加了<em>更多</em>边框和功能！</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/jolly-tooltips\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_139f83d7-2461-4ef3-a360-c3eeb241a7cb.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"86\" height=\"86\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/rarity-tooltips/gallery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"color:#fff\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1916/855/256/256/639195121866576493.png\" alt=\"Rarity Tooltips 标志放大图\" width=\"86\" height=\"86\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><strong>展示 📷</strong></h1>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如需更多信息，请访问 <a href=\"https://github.com/Xylonity/Tooltip-Overhaul/wiki/Content-and-examples\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">维基页面</a>。</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong>提示框动画</strong></h2>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>fade</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_48fc295c-19d5-448d-8363-9fcc532120a2.gif\" width=\"485\" height=\"273\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>pop</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_2188bce6-74c5-40c3-bcf5-d0f22dfa7fb9.gif\" width=\"485\" height=\"273\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>rise</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_ff1b0797-8fc4-4fe3-8bb0-f508fe3a4064.gif\" width=\"485\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>unfold</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_963e1610-587e-4ba4-8b3c-a3054ad4adfc.gif\" width=\"485\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>zoom</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_c96dd448-1171-48af-b7ca-4db2af12e1c1.gif\" width=\"485\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>slide</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_f936790c-b1b2-4e4f-95f3-405a212f6a5f.gif\" width=\"485\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>swing</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_7ec82a7e-0972-465e-bb37-2493cdc899cf.gif\" width=\"485\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>emerge</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_2bb03399-c62c-48b3-a437-c475e49ee63d.gif\" width=\"485\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>squash</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_8dcbb067-ca3e-47bd-8444-1c96d748862e.gif\" width=\"485\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>card</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_eaafe36a-2c90-4a95-a4eb-568c7bb64500.gif\" width=\"485\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>shake</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_193d899e-fd7b-4272-a3ae-ba51ab30f89a.gif\" width=\"485\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2><strong><br>图标动画</strong></h2>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>zoom</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_710de09a-00ff-4dbf-a52c-e7fd191a8238.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"225\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>rotate</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_96fcdc92-aec7-4e72-8362-0afc6bf10907.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>rotate_fast</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_f662105e-aaac-45f1-9fcd-86e07fc98f25.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>rotate_zoom</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_8e693f98-e831-4747-a49a-780caaac7e4f.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>zoom_snap</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_0801c7e9-7401-4411-9813-55470e190b0f.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>skew</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_daf92bbe-e6e4-4615-bd68-9c9e7445f77e.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>vibration</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_da3a6e73-2f1f-4351-8708-1eeac1fb7c2c.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>tilt_wave</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_e9de8114-60b6-4eea-9490-165cd845469f.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>flip</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_7ade282e-49b3-4c28-bdb2-d7a77d610bf3.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>pendulum</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_e907728e-75aa-4f50-8115-d457a7eeeb19.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>bounce</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_867a38c4-1f48-4396-a8bf-9504fab84ea3.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>go_down</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_b39aef12-e088-4801-8971-7962fbef5c99.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>pulse</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_d41863b1-11a5-4c07-a127-ff15524f20ab.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>fan_in</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_5c43e9d5-03fc-4497-8c1b-c2c367c32a9c.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>hover_pop</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_da470af0-1239-4df2-ad7f-64c6bd63405f.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>barrel_roll</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_e8ea3b98-47b1-42a9-bdb0-e26d2c7eb643.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong>特效</strong></h2>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>metal_shining</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/qFedqV8.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p><br>nebula<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_745e0555-e12a-43df-abfb-0f4b48e7af3a.gif\" width=\"398\" height=\"224\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>echo</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_c9a01ea9-6900-479a-8bb2-cce21d559607.gif\" width=\"401\" height=\"226\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>speed_lines</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_14d36d67-1da3-4bcd-a606-196a7286913a.gif\" width=\"405\" height=\"228\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>white_dust</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_85b3c1da-5800-4828-a267-092facdfad7c.gif\" width=\"403\" height=\"227\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>galaxy</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_55e6c529-e55d-440a-a78b-9996fcc93731.gif\" width=\"401\" height=\"226\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>spiral</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_0607039c-7936-4500-8753-89dde6b156df.gif\" width=\"401\" height=\"226\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>orbs</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_1d08b434-77a6-4808-b0c8-32f06abe3ee7.gif\" width=\"401\" height=\"226\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>rim_light</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/o0gMIwU.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>ripples</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/FwumAw7.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>sonar</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LRU7jVR.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>stars</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wiTPtpy.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>cinder</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/N1Yfe7n.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"180\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>fireflies</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_50727a44-3613-4260-a919-72c0a65fb6b2.gif\" width=\"478\" height=\"269\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\nbubbles\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_bc2279f7-9943-4f52-9839-fd6bd6d1ff10.gif\" width=\"483\" height=\"272\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>crystals</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_bea809ef-8da8-4504-900d-11db6c4740be.gif\" width=\"488\" height=\"275\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong>边框类型</strong></h2>\n\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>默认</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_c22806ec-e245-4ade-97e3-da624ee4618b.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>圆角</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_c74cb4b7-04bb-489c-9bdd-2c591e72160e.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>斜面</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_92ff48d3-ea83-4238-b779-9a5936a00d0b.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>内嵌</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_438bfdfb-a1c8-459c-bdde-62df0f59bcbd.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>切割</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_7e324ee5-e7c3-434d-ae94-bf3b8e1c89db.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>加厚</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_b8d4fc90-c538-4378-b9cb-d13ad23e24a2.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>括号</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_4360befb-8c2e-4940-87e6-3e3a07eca2b9.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>方块</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_a738c462-a20b-4991-acd3-f482c7959a41.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>凹槽</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_af7669d2-ddff-44f0-9c57-7f1c23a3a254.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>焊接</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_91bec7fc-b7f2-4778-8e52-83e5bb484bcd.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>宝石</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_ccc5d7a0-9234-4179-ad8a-5fbab6497664.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong>提示框边框</strong></h2>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>- amber_frame.png</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_baca4ef8-e32c-4943-9b72-585d14a90757.png\" width=\"264\"></p>\n<p>- amethyst_frame.png</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_9422751d-3e2e-4924-a7b0-8b49d1eb11f2.png\" width=\"264\"></p>\n<p>- angelical_frame.png</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_6dcb7eeb-a5dd-4ac0-9480-cb60ee7a7ad4.png\" width=\"264\"></p>\n<p>- battle_frame.png</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_07bf3456-f9c7-4345-8faf-9889396b8228.png\" width=\"264\"></p>\n<p>- cataclysm_frame.png</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_ebb1c767-10e9-48e2-8567-456b1b84f968.png\" width=\"264\"></p>\n<p>- demonic_frame.png</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_ca5a36e8-c693-4b07-a6a6-67c2fa92c023.gif\" width=\"264\"></p>\n<p>- diamond_frame.png</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_ab4b1236-659a-4298-9cae-5ef103383adb.png\" width=\"264\"></p>\n<p>- emerald_frame.png</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_5abf01b7-b648-4d8e-b6bc-cec029a5c625.png\" width=\"264\"></p>\n<p>- fire_frame.png</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachmen