1327508/description_5dfb890e-cf0f-4f6b-8347-746d71621fff.png\" width=\"264\" height=\"264\"></p>\n<p><br>- plasma_lamp_frame.png</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_e8e0178f-f2d5-435c-be18-e627cb71359e.png\" width=\"264\" height=\"264\"></p>\n<p>- neon_fire_frame.png</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_43e24e70-d5ae-4949-aa4a-c3e5d38658c4.png\" width=\"264\" height=\"264\"></p>\n<p><br>- garden_frame.png</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_3334b176-b44e-44b1-aba3-7f339b50fd71.png\" width=\"264\" height=\"264\"></p>\n<p><br>- construction_punk_frame.png</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_2a25eb06-6e05-42fc-92fd-08ccd3c6f31e.png\" width=\"264\" height=\"264\"></p>\n<p><br>- cavemen_frame.png</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_eb0d181c-18b6-41b6-820a-eba6a274ac56.png\" width=\"264\" height=\"264\"></p>\n<p><br>- nuclear_alarm_frame.png</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_e3ccf7cc-938a-49f2-ab90-1033399627a2.png\" width=\"264\" height=\"264\"></p>\n<p><br>- gummy_bear_frame.png</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_2e288886-4f4c-4f88-9e3a-517473b8d07f.png\" width=\"264\" height=\"264\"></p>\n<p><br>- greek_temple_frame.png</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_a37f58df-8ba9-4ce0-b63a-12c938fb34d9.png\" width=\"264\" height=\"264\"></p>\n<p><br>- pure_alchemy_frame.png</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_ea50cd7b-0819-4fb4-a8f6-057989d94d91.png\" width=\"264\" height=\"264\"></p>\n<p>- skyland_frame.png<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_25f8541e-a6d9-4a3e-a069-79ebccc0ee17.png\" width=\"264\" height=\"264\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong>暗角效果</strong></h2>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>圆形</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_0cba7784-f252-4ec4-9205-efb9963933a0.gif\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>镂空</p>\n<p><img><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_58beecac-0e05-43e8-aa29-4e367af662db.gif\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong>游戏内配置界面与实时预览</strong></h2>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_8199bce4-d6a1-41e3-893f-e02bf196319a.gif\" width=\"742\" height=\"417\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_7cdf7ef2-6e3d-4024-ad6a-5e9506783848.gif\" width=\"742\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_a50be5c8-79f7-49c8-875b-cdf3fef9065e.gif\" width=\"742\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong>高度自定义</strong></h2>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>多种风格！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/NsOvwXU.gif\" width=\"600\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>自由组合效果！</p>\n<p><img><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1327508/description_c16824dd-21a7-4d09-8f3d-9761b1f194d6.gif\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><strong>其他信息 📝</strong></h1>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">本模组完全为客户端模组。</span></span></p>\n<p><em><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Fabric 与 Forge 版本均无需外部依赖，只需下载本模组并放入 mods 文件夹即可开始游玩！</span></span></em></p>\n<p><em>在 Fabric 版本中访问游戏内配置，您需要&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ModMenu</a>！</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><strong>制作人员 📦</strong></h1>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Xylonity - 程序开发与模组设计</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">TheModderG - 提示框边框与模组图标设计</span></span></p>",
